      "id": "claim_fcdc129e592c4bb4b74cd76f7395409d",
      "statement": "The paired-fidelity callback resolves its paired dataset lazily at the first gated epoch via getattr(datamodule, 'val_latent_ds', datamodule), so the cold path's post-setup replacement of the warmed validation dataset is honored instead of being captured at build time.",
