    {
      "id": "claim_e68803002fbd4ae7b7176ab4f5baba7e",
      "statement": "The paired-fidelity monitor is observe-only: it never enters the loss, the optimizer or the EMA and does not drive checkpoint selection — declaring val/psnr and val/ssim in logged_metrics only makes them validatable monitor candidates, while the supervised checkpoint monitor remains val/x0_mae.",
