    {
      "id": "claim_b1b19cb3a6014e869f72114a8955db5e",
      "statement": "Under DDP every rank runs the paired-fidelity monitor redundantly on the same fixed subset under the same seeded noise on DDP-synchronized weights, so the only cross-rank interaction is Lightning's torchmetrics sync (no FID-style sharding or error-rendezvous machinery); the 2-rank gate asserts identical logged and rank-local values on both ranks and an unchanged val/x0_mae checkpoint monitor.",
