    {
      "id": "claim_8b7c51fac7fc47c8868bff9ce0e8aec8",
      "statement": "The GRPO ControlNet policy path forbids the FID callback and the val/fid monitor through the spine's generic forbidden_callbacks / forbidden_monitors maps — because unconditional FID ignores the ControlNet and is a constant frozen-base metric — so neither a YAML knob nor a --callbacks override can re-enable it.",
