      "id": "claim_81290c97393a4afcb0dc5693b52c4875",
      "statement": "The per-shell default callback-name sets are dynamic: JiT starts with ['train_loss'] and appends 'fid' only when FID is attached, plus 'checkpoint'; GRPO starts with ['checkpoint'] and appends 'fid' only when the FID triple is active (its 'train_loss' spec is registered but not enabled by default); the reward shell uses ['checkpoint']; the supervised ControlNet shell uses ['train_loss', 'checkpoint', 'paired_fidelity'].",
