      "statement": "ADR-0037 explicitly scopes the paired-fidelity monitor to the supervised ControlNet stage: extending it to the ControlNet-GRPO path (which would require releasing the blanket forbidden_callbacks guard for this callback and keeping the VAE on GPU for the decode) is a deliberate follow-up, not part of the shipped change.",
